@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Criar perfil
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Maria Silva","email":"maria@example.com","bio":"Desenvolvedora full-stack"}

### Criar tecnologia
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/technologies
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Node.js","category":"Runtime"}

### Listar tecnologias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/technologies

### Criar projeto (substitua os IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"DevShowcase","description":"Plataforma para exibir projetos de desenvolvedores","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/exemplo/devshowcase","profileId":1,"technologyIds":[1]}

### Listar projetos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### Buscar perfil (substitua o ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/1
